<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Edit Post</title>
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.7/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet"
        crossorigin="anonymous" />
</head>

<body>
    <nav class="navbar navbar-dark bg-dark shadow-sm">
        <div class="container d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center">
            <a href="/posts" class="navbar-brand d-flex align-items-center">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                    stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true" class="me-2"
                    viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                    <path d="M23 19a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H3a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h4l2-3h6l2 3h4a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"></path>
                    <circle cx="12" cy="13" r="4"></circle>
                </svg>
                <strong>PictoPost</strong>
            </a>

            <button class="navbar-toggler" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#navbarHeader"
                aria-controls="navbarHeader" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Toggle navigation">
                <span class="navbar-toggler-icon"></span>
            </button>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <div class="collapse bg-dark text-white" id="navbarHeader">
        <div class="container py-4">
            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-sm-8 col-md-7">
                    <h4>About</h4>
                    <p>Add some information about the album below, the author, or any other background context. Make it
                        a few
                        sentences long so folks can pick up some informative tidbits. Then, link them off to some social
                        networking
                        sites or contact information.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="col-sm-4 offset-md-1">
                    <h4>Contact</h4>
                    <ul class="list-unstyled">
                        <li><a href="#" class="text-white">Follow on X</a></li>
                        <li><a href="#" class="text-white">Like on Facebook</a></li>
                        <li><a href="#" class="text-white">Email me</a></li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="container m-5">
        <h5>ID: <%= post.id %>
        </h5>
        <h6>Username: <%= post.username %>
        </h6>
        <h6 class="fst-italic">@<%= post.username.toLowerCase() %>
        </h6>

        <% if(post.url) { %>
            <div class="mb-3">
                <label class="form-label">Current Image:</label><br />
                <img src="<%= post.url %>" alt="Post Image" class="img-fluid rounded" style="max-width: 300px;" />
            </div>
            <% } %>

                <form action="/posts/<%= post.id %>?_method=PATCH" method="POST" enctype="multipart/form-data"
                    novalidate>
                    <div class="mb-3">
                        <label for="inputUsername" class="form-label">Username</label>
                        <input type="text" id="inputUsername" name="username" class="form-control"
                            value="<%= post.username %>" readonly />
                    </div>

                    <div class="mb-3">
                        <label for="inputContext" class="form-label">Context</label>
                        <textarea id="inputContext" name="context" class="form-control" rows="3"
                            required><%= post.context %></textarea>
                    </div>

                    <div class="mb-3">
                        <label for="inputImageUrl" class="form-label">Image URL</label>
                        <input type="url" id="inputImageUrl" name="imageUrl" class="form-control"
                            pattern="^$|https?://.+"
                            value="<%= post.url && !post.url.startsWith('/') ? post.url : '' %>"
                            placeholder="Paste new image URL here (optional)" />

                        <div class="form-text">Or upload a new image below. Leave both blank to keep the current image.
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="mb-3">
                        <label for="inputImageFile" class="form-label">Upload New Image File</label>
                        <input type="file" id="inputImageFile" name="imageFile" accept="image/*" class="form-control" />
                    </div>

                    <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">Save</button>
                </form>
    </div>
<footer class="text-white py-5 bg-dark mt-auto">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="float-end mb-1">
      <a href="#" class="text-white">Back to top</a>
    </p>
    <p class="mb-1">© 2025 PictoPost. All rights reserved.</p>
    <p class="mb-0">
      New to PictoPost? <a href="/posts/new" class="text-white text-decoration-underline">Create your first post</a> or read our
      <a href="index.md" class="text-white text-decoration-underline">Getting Started Guide</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</footer>


    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.7/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"
        crossorigin="anonymous"></script>
</body>

</html>